OL,3,GNEWSARed Devils to skydive over Douglas
OL,4,ABay
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Red Devils will perform a free
OL,7,Fparachute display over Douglas Bay
OL,8,Ftomorrow, despite the Manx Grand Prix
OL,9,Fand Classic TT competition having been
OL,10,Fcancelled.
OL,12,FThe elite Army display is planning to
OL,13,Fjump from up to 10,000ft (3048m) on
OL,14,FThursday 27 August.
OL,16,FParachutists will land on Douglas
OL,17,FBeach, opposite the Villa Marina, from
OL,18,F19:30.
OL,20,FThe Red Devils Army Parachute Display
OL,21,FTeam is made up of serving soldiers
OL,22,Ffrom the Parachute Regiment.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
